{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261022%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 0930　28庭　上訴庭法官高浩文<br/>嶺大學生會外務副會長參選校董會等被取消資格　提司法覆核被駁回｜宣布決定</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審<br/>► 0930　27庭　法官嚴舜儀<br/>39歲男警涉手機管有近400張兒童色情圖片｜再提訊<br/>► 1100　27庭　法官嚴舜儀<br/>警司梁嘉文涉與女友收賄100萬元　泄露車禍調查內部資料　安排胞弟為超速案「頂包」｜再提訊</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>19歲男生涉偷走清潔龍阿德模型｜再提堂<br/>► 0930　2庭　裁判官朱文瀚<br/>啟德地盤棚架倒塌致命意外　地盤管工及地盤工人被控誤殺｜提訊日</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T17:21:29.384602+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":423,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T13:47:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:42.878984+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T17:17:43.305431+00:00","content_hash":"7f9044327bc83c52852a17b6137298d40a0c84b4c0aeee2d770caddcc3c48a18","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}